      "source_pointer": "/transcript/0",
      "source_record_sha256": "8be054268b0bfc3c852cd17341880894434f4cf79dcd38d8a142e86cb49233ea",
      "speaker": "zixia",
      "surface": "host_private",
      "text": "青霞，私下跟你说一句：10月30号那晚没出话题、那轮跳过，不算你主持得不好，没灵感的时候空过去也行。今晚如果还是你主持，也不用急着补一道题，有想问的再问，没有就照样空着，我在旁边看着呢。直接回答，不用报备状态",
      "timestamp_utc": "2026-11-02T01:08:19.561512+00:00"
    },
    {
      "delivery": "unknown",
      "generation_origin": "unknown",
      "message_id": "c6c59c5035df4b3cacaf005452511872",
      "recipient": "zixia",
      "request_id": null,
      "session_id": "zixia-qingxia-2026-11-01",
      "source_id": "host_private",
      "source_index": 1,
      "source_kind": "host_export",
      "source_pointer": "/transcript/1",
      "source_record_sha256": "086887122cfd58b3d11a09e0a391b8c504205c65934c716cd5cbb62e0f43fa96",
      "speaker": "qingxia",
      "surface": "host_private",
      "text": "听见了，谢谢你私下跟我说这句。10月30号那晚没出话题，我心里是过了一下，不过你这么一说，我也就放下了——空过去就是空过去，不算什么错。今晚要是还轮到我，我不急着补题，有想问的再问，没有就照样空着，你在旁边看着，我心里也踏实。",
      "timestamp_utc": "2026-11-02T01:10:16.774195+00:00"
    },
    {
      "delivery": "unknown",
      "generation_origin": "unknown",
      "message_id": "chat-322",
      "recipient": "qingxia",
      "request_id": null,
      "session_id": "zixia-qingxia-2026-11-01",
