      "speaker": "zixia",
      "surface": "host_private",
      "text": "青霞，嗯，就是这个意思，你放下了就好，今晚怎么都行，我都在。直接回答，不用报备状态",
      "timestamp_utc": "2026-11-02T01:10:45.980518+00:00"
    },
    {
      "delivery": "unknown",
      "generation_origin": "unknown",
      "message_id": "3319a8874cd94f63a7d3e5b0fbaba482",
